### Flash Booking - roteiro de demonstracao
### Compativel com JetBrains HTTP Client e VS Code REST Client.
### Execute os requests em ordem.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@idemKey = demo-key-001

### 1. Criar evento
# @name createEvent
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Java Festival", "capacity": 50 }

###
@eventId = {{createEvent.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Consultar evento (disponibilidade pode estar defasada ~1s por causa do cache)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}

### 3. Reservar (Idempotency-Key obrigatoria) -> 201 + Location
# @name createReservation
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idemKey}}

{ "quantity": 2 }

###
@reservationId = {{createReservation.response.body.$.id}}

### 4. Repetir a mesma chave e o mesmo body -> mesma resposta + Idempotent-Replayed: true
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idemKey}}

{ "quantity": 2 }

### 5. Mesma chave com quantity diferente -> 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_CONFLICT
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idemKey}}

{ "quantity": 3 }

### 6. Consultar reserva -> PENDING (ou EXPIRED apos o TTL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}

### 7. Cancelar reserva -> 204 (devolve o estoque)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}

### 8. Cancelar de novo -> 204 (idempotente, nao devolve estoque outra vez)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}

### 9. Consultar evento (pode levar ~1s para refletir, cache local por instancia)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}

### 10. Erro de validacao: quantity invalida -> 400 INVALID_QUANTITY
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-invalid

{ "quantity": 0 }

### 11. Erro de validacao: sem Idempotency-Key -> 400 MISSING_IDEMPOTENCY_KEY
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 1 }

### 12. Erro de validacao: capacity invalida -> 400 INVALID_CAPACITY
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Evento invalido", "capacity": 0 }

### 13. Evento inexistente -> 404 EVENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 14. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### 15. Metricas
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/reservations.created
